    <title>Problems</title>
    <text><table><thead><tr><th>Problem</th><th>Clinical status</th><th>Verification</th><th>Code</th><th>Provenance</th></tr></thead><tbody>
  <tr ID="problem-1">
    <td>Chronic low back and pelvic pain after remote spinal and pelvic fractures and spinal surgery, with neuropathic features in the right leg; linked to the documented 1925 injuries</td><td>active</td><td>confirmed</td>
    <td>G89.21</td><td>S — Synthetic modern diagnosis linked to the documented injuries; the neuropathic interpretation is R.</td>
  </tr>
  <tr ID="problem-2">
    <td>Post-traumatic osteoarthritis of the right ankle and foot after multiple leg fractures and a foot dislocation</td><td>active</td><td>confirmed</td>
    <td>M19.171</td><td>S — Synthetic diagnosis confirmed on the synthetic ankle X-ray.</td>
  </tr>
  <tr ID="problem-3">
